ed_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aWrfoWJFBVQcgMVaD6Bvyw","review_id":"BEfbZQwSfwfm3VrVrZIuNA","date":"2021-11-13T07:07:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9391723275184631,"text_excerpt":"I love stop jocking, although I never know what I want! They have soooooo many choices for the snowballs and the four I've had were all delicious, especially in New Orleans summer humidity. Favorite thing to snack on is the crawfish nachos. Corner vibe, free parking and cool family. Service is quick and at the window."},{"business_id":"aWrfoWJFBVQcgMVaD6Bvyw","review_id":"xtaSUQ0s42wpxcoFV-0JVg","date":"2019-09-02T17:11:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9225186109542847,"text_excerpt":"So we were coming back to Nola from a long day at the historical plantations outside the city and someone mentioned how we should try a famous New Orleans snowball. I quickly went to yelp to try to find a local place that had parking and good reviews. We ended up at stop jockin. What a great name! Lol! I got a watermelon snowball and it was awesome!!! He just kept pouring and pouring the syrup over the freshly crushed ice. A few minutes later my entire mouth was red with the evidence of how good the moment was!"},{"business_id":"aWrfoWJFBVQcgMVaD6Bvyw","review_id":"cNlr6pxq3jwPYyuCw2jXBg","date":"2019-06-14T12:47:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9059411287307739,"text_excerpt":"What we call snow-cones at home. Except theirs are kicked up a notch. You can get nachos and cheese. Hot fries and cheese. Crawfish fries with cheese. It was really hard deciding what to get. I went with a peach and blueberry snow cone. I also couldn't leave without getting nachos and cheese with peppers after seeing the person before me order some and that made my mouth water. The snowball was really good the syrup was intensely sweet for me so I couldn't finish it. At home we have to ask for extra in New Orleans I guess we have to ask for light syrup."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aWrfoWJFBVQcgMVaD6Bvyw","photo_id":"Q3RpX2k1U-pLvJEGFmW22w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Q3RpX2k1U-pLvJEGFmW22w.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
